Domain Entity FieldworkExperience
    documentation "The information regarding a post-secondary instructional course in a particular field of study that typically involves a prescribed number, instruction periods, or meetings for enrolled students."
    shared string FieldworkIdentifier
        documentation "The unique identifier for the fieldwork experience."
        is part of identity
    domain entity EdFi.Student
        documentation "The student associated with the fieldwork experience."
        is part of identity
    domain entity EdFi.School
        documentation "The school the fieldwork experience is conducted in."
        is optional
    domain entity EducatorPreparationProgram
        documentation "The educator preparation program the fieldwork experience is associated with."
        is optional
    descriptor FieldworkType
        documentation "The type of fieldwork being executed by a staff."
        is required
    shared decimal HoursCompleted
        documentation "The number of hours completed during the fieldwork experience."
        is optional
    date BeginDate
        documentation "The month, day, and year on which the staff first starts fieldwork. Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is part of identity
    date EndDate
        documentation "The month, day, and year on which the staff ends fieldwork. Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional
    common Coteaching
        documentation "The act of two teachers (teacher candidate and cooperating teacher) working together with groups of students; sharing the planning, organization, delivery, and assessment of instruction, as well as the physical space."
        is optional

